input: Keep the first character typed into the search panel

Since 0660be4c, set_search_query anchors a changed query to the viewport.
The panel's own typing calls it, so the first character moves the anchor
from None to the viewport start. The overlay compared anchors to tell the
panel's echo from an outside change, so it re-showed the panel, which
selects the query, and the next keystroke replaced it: typing "Docker"
after opening search left "ocker".

An anchor change is now part of the echo when the panel already holds the
session's query. Opening search again still re-shows the panel, because it
bumps the activation revision.

Send upstream; remove once GPUI Kit releases the fix.

diff --git a/tests/integration/input/editor.rs b/tests/integration/input/editor.rs
